name: Complete tall engine lists, honest compact continuation and compatibility guidance
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN SEMGREP_AGENT_TOKEN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/engine_readiness.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
submit: run context:build {"enrichment":false}
require-live-snap: 35 context:build indexed | source-indexed
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: setg taskMode manual
submit: setg tasks semgrep
paste-file: @ART/binary-setting.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/engine_readiness.py @TMP_TARGET @ART globals
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | study
keys: Home Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 DEPENDENCY MISSING: semgrepBinary | initial-selection
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 systems-hunt | complete-tall-list
expect: Automatic selection
expect: [Labs] codeql
expect: [Labs] taint-iris-next
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/engine_choice_visibility.py @TMP_TARGET @ART tall
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 systems-hunt · model required | tall-bottom-selection
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 systems-hunt · model required | bottom-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/engine_choice_visibility.py @TMP_TARGET @ART bottom
keys: Up Up Up Up
require-live-snap: 15 agentic · model required | middle-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/engine_choice_visibility.py @TMP_TARGET @ART middle
keys: Up Up Up Up Up Up Up Up
require-live-snap: 15 DEPENDENCY MISSING: semgrepBinary | top-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/engine_choice_visibility.py @TMP_TARGET @ART top
expect: r check
ask: Do the scrollbar and directional markers expose hidden choices at both ends, with the selected engine and its actionable detail still readable at 40 columns?
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 DEPENDENCY MISSING: semgrepBinary | list-60x20
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 DEPENDENCY MISSING: semgrepBinary | list-80x24
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 15 systems-hunt | list-120x36
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 systems-hunt | list-160x48
ask: Are all choices discoverable across six sizes, with all fourteen rows visible in the tall terminal and selection, detail paging and controls preserved through resize?
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 compatibility task alias for taint-iris-next | legacy-alias
expect: taint-iris-next:hunt
keys: Down
require-live-snap: 20 next taint workflow | recommended-replacement
expect: taint-iris-next:hunt
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Discovery engines  current settings | cancelled
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/engine_choice_visibility.py @TMP_TARGET @ART cancelled
ask: Does compatibility guidance identify the replacement without implying an extra engine or coverage, while Cancel retains the original study and global settings without creating work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | restarted-study
keys: Home Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 DEPENDENCY MISSING: semgrepBinary | restarted-selection
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 systems-hunt | restarted-tall-list
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 systems-hunt · model required | restarted-bottom-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/engine_choice_visibility.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted-bottom
keys: Escape
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/engine_choice_visibility.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart keep the original choices and honest continuation at the bottom, with no source change, plan, attempt, reservation or model request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
